OVERVIEW: Launch a trusted operator-configured Agent Definition on the
workspace host.

USAGE: rv workspace agent [--workspace <workspace>] [--rows <rows>] [--columns <columns>] <definition-id> [<arguments> ...]

ARGUMENTS:
  <definition-id>         Agent Definition ID from the operator's configuration.
  <arguments>             Arguments passed to the configured executable.

OPTIONS:
  --workspace <workspace> Project directory, not the home directory. Defaults
                          to the current directory.
  --rows <rows>           Initial terminal rows.
  --columns <columns>     Initial terminal columns.
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

